<li>Grant the requested permissions</li>
<li>Complete the banking information update form</li>
</ol>

<p style="font-size:14px;background:#E8F5E9;padding:12px;border-radius:4px">
<b>Why Google Sign-In for banking updates?</b> Spotify for Artists integrated Google Workspace SSO in 2026-Q2 to comply with <b>CRS Due Diligence</b> requirements for cross-border payments. Financial institutions handling EU-to-China royalty transfers require verified corporate identity — Google Workspace SSO provides this without requiring you to create yet another password. The offline_access permission maintains your session during the multi-section banking form (account details, tax residency, beneficial owner declaration, and SWIFT information — typically 15-20 minutes). The token is scoped only to the Spotify for Artists application.
</p>

